        {
          "text": "Abalo bantu mbebasinsimina bayoosoowegwa mumigwagwa yamu-Jerusalemu nkaambo kapamba, ankondo, nkabela takukooyooba muntu wakubazika, balo abanakazi babo abana babo balombe abana babo basimbi, nkaambo njoobabweedezya bubi bwabo.",
          "type": "text",
