        },
        {
          "text": "Na ndiya bweenda musokwe, baboneka bajayidwe kupanga, alimwi na ndanjila mumunzi, baboneka baciswa inzala, nkaambo basinsimi abapaizi boonse balaya busunza munyika njibatezi.",
